  "id": "USN-8872-1",
  "summary": "libxmltok vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that Expat, contained with the xmltok library did not\ncorrectly handle certain integer arithmetic. If a user or automated\nsystem were tricked into opening a specially crafted file, an attacker\ncould possibly cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-56404, CVE-2026-56405)",
